#: kasaboutdlg.cpp:24 kasaboutdlg.cpp:37
msgid "About Kasbar"
msgstr "Ve^` Kasbar"

#: kasaboutdlg.cpp:48
msgid "<qt><body><h2>Kasbar Version: %1</h2><b>CVS Id:</b> %2</body></qt>"
msgstr "<qt><body><h2>Phie^n ba?n Kasbar : %1</h2><b>CVS Id:</b> %2</body></qt>"

#: kasaboutdlg.cpp:56
msgid ""
"<html><body><p>Kasbar TNG began as a port of the original Kasbar applet to "
"the (then new) extension API, but ended up as a complete rewrite because of "
"the range of features needed by different groups of users. In the process of "
"the rewrite all the standard features provided by the default taskbar were "
"added, along with some more original ones such as thumbnails.</p><p>You can "
"find infomation about the latest developments in Kasbar at <a href=\"%3\">%"
"4</a>, the Kasbar homepage.</p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><body><p>Kasbar TNG ddu+o+.c ba('t dda^`u la` port cu?a applet Kasbar "
"vo+'i nhie^`u API mo+'i. Tuy nhie^n cuo^'i cu`ng no' ddu+o+.c vie^'t la.i toa`n bo^."
"vi` pha.m vi ca'c chu+'c na(ng ca^`n thie^'t bo+?i nhie^`u nho'm ngu+o+`i du`ng kha'c nhau."
"Trong qua' tri`nh vie^'t la.i ta^'t ca? ca'c chu+'c na(ng chua^?n ddu+o+.c cung ca^'p bo+?i"
" taskbar ma(.c ddi.nh dda~ ddu+o+.c the^m va`o. Cu`ng vo+'i ddo' la` ca'c chu+'c na(ng cu~ nhu+"
"thumbnail</p><p>"
"Ba.n co the^? ti`m tha^'y nhie^`u tho^ng tin ho+n o+? dda^y: <a href=\"%3\">%"
"4</a>, Kasbar homepage.</p></body></html>"

